{"title":"Franchise Canada Show Toronto — Fall 2026 (Sunday)","startsAt":"2026-10-25T11:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-25T16:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Ready to become your own boss—but don’t want to build a business entirely on your own?\nJoin fellow entrepreneurs, business builders, and opportunity seekers at the **Franchise Canada Show Toronto — Fall 2026**, Canada’s premier franchise exhibition. This free event brings leading franchise brands, experienced operators, and industry experts together under one roof at the Toronto Congress Centre.\nWhether you’re actively exploring business ownership or simply curious about franchising, this is an opportunity to discover proven business models, compare investment options, and get practical guidance directly from the people who know the industry best.\n\n## What you’ll discover\n\n**Explore franchise opportunities across 60+ sectors**\nMeet representatives from established brands and emerging concepts in food, technology, beauty, construction, professional services, retail, and more. Explore opportunities at a wide range of investment levels and find options that match your experience, ambitions, and budget.\n**Speak directly with industry experts**\nConnect face-to-face with franchisors, successful franchisees, and experienced professionals. Ask candid questions, understand the realities of ownership, and gain insights that can help you make a confident, informed decision.\n**Attend free educational seminars**\nLearn about financing, legal considerations, marketing, operations, franchise selection, and other essential aspects of building a successful franchise business. Hear practical strategies and real-world lessons from people who have already made the journey.\n\n## Why attend?\n\nSince 1996, the Canadian Franchise Association has helped thousands of Canadians explore business ownership through credible franchise systems. The Franchise Canada Show is the CFA’s official exhibition and one of the best places to begin—or accelerate—your search.\nCome prepared to learn, make valuable connections, and discover what your next chapter could look like.\n**Get into business for yourself—but not by yourself.**\nAttendance is free, but advance registration is encouraged. Reserve your place through the official Eventbrite listing:\n**[Register for the Franchise Canada Show Toronto](https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/franchise-canada-show-toronto-fall-2026-tickets-1989674641413?aff=oddtdtcreator)**\n**Location:** Toronto Congress Centre, Hall F, Toronto, Ontario\n**Official organizer:** Canadian Franchise Association / Franchise Canada Show\n*Please note: LeaderSHIFT and Toronto Tech Hangout are sharing this opportunity with their communities and are not the official event organizers.*\n**Questions or Concerns?**\nNeed support with your LeaderSHIFT Meetup experience? [Submit a support request](https://tally.so/r/68zJZo).","venue":{"name":"Toronto Congress Centre","address":"650 Dixon Road, Toronto","lat":43.692024,"lng":-79.57836,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Tech Hangout","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/b/0/b/highres_532059691.jpeg"}